                                                "sense_id": "a904b830-99f2-335b-99e2-0d77aa8a81f2",
                                                "text": "It was firm enough to walk on, but Bradly took off his boots to preserve the leather from sea-water, and for the pleasure of barefoot walking on cool sand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
